bluejetty:00001741:android.description:
Transport Mod for Minecraft PE installs a mod that adds a large number of new vehicles to the game such as cars, boats, planes, buses, motorcycles, helicopters and more! Our mods minecraft are constantly updated, so we advise you to stay tuned for new updates. 
 If you want the application to develop, give a rating and write a review 
How does Transport Mods work? 
Everything is quite simple, problems can arise if this is your first installation and if they are advised to contact us by mail or find an article on the Internet how to install (there is a text instruction in the application). After you installed everything correctly, go to MCPE itself, be sure to connect the mod when creating the map, and now it remains to go into the creative mode, then go into the inventory and find the vehicles or transport that you need.
The list of vehicles in Minecraft PE:
1) Car;
2) Submarine;
3) Airplane;
4) A machine that can jump;
5) Mini bus;
6) Mini bike;
7) Mini train;
8) Locomotive;
9) Helicopter;
10) Cars on the radio;
11) Race car.
Also in this application you will find a bonus mod adon and map on the topic of transport
The Transport Mod Minecraft PE app supports MCPE versions 1.10, 1.11, 1.12, 1.13.
disclaimer:
Not an official Minecraft product. Not endorsed by or affiliated with Mojang

