bluejetty:00031164:android.description:
Application "Motivators!" – your personal assistant for forming healthy habits.
Want to exercise or learn a new skill? Are you looking to increase productivity or have a goal to get rid of bad habits? A long journey begins with small steps. And now you don’t have to make positive changes alone.
What is the application “Motivators!” different from other habit trackers?
For each task you can choose your own motivator. He will send messages and videos to support you in achieving your goal. After all, sometimes it is so important for someone to praise your successes, cheer you up after a failure, or even scold you a little for laziness.
Who are your motivators?
Russian comedians, actors of the show “Improvisers” on the STS TV channel Arseny Popov, Dmitry Pozov, Sergey Matvienko and Anton Shastun.
What else awaits in the application?
• Simple and concise interface;
• Dozens of ideas for useful habits;
• Progress report for the day, week, month and year;
• Push notifications and reminders about goals and habits;
• No advertising.

